{"text": "Kiddle & Co Bookkeeping - client file note\nClient: Lachlan Petherbridge t/as Petherbridge Electrical     Client code PETH01\nNote by Bronwyn Kiddle (BAS agent no. 24718803) after meeting at his place, Tues 4/11/25\n\nDETAILS\nABN 51 824 753 556   TFN 481 207 339   DOB 17/03/1986\nHome / business address: Unit 4, 18 Wattle Grove Road, Marrickville NSW 2204\nMob 0491 570 156   lachie@petherbridgeelectrical.example\nElectrical contractor licence 348817C, NSW driver licence 19044712\nBusiness account: Illawarra Mutual Bank, BSB 641-800, acct 10447 2218\nWork ute: 2021 HiLux, rego CX41TZ - logbook kept from 1 July, 78% business so far\n\nSEPT QUARTER BAS (due 25 Nov through us)\n- Sales incl GST $68,442.00, GST collected $6,222\n- Purchases incl GST $21,907.50, GST credits $1,991.59\n- PAYG instalment $3,150. Net payable about $7,380. He hasn't got it. Wants a payment plan; ATO debt from last year is still $11,260.45 on the running balance account.\n- One apprentice, Mele Taufahema, started 11/08/2025, $24.80/hr. Single Touch Payroll not lodged for 3 pays. Super goes to SunCoast Tradies Super, member no. STS-4471209. Mele's TFN declaration is on file: 602 118 457, DOB 9 Feb 2006.\n\nTHINGS HE TOLD ME (not for the accountant's letter)\n- Lachie and his partner split in June. He pays child support for two kids through Services Australia, $412 a fortnight, comes out of the business account - recode to drawings.\n- He's been off the tools since the shoulder reconstruction in September; income protection claim no. IP-22087341 pays $1,150 a week, taxable.\n- His Medicare card for the claim forms: 2951 84417 3, ref 1.\n- Xero login is his email; he wrote the password on the whiteboard, Sparky#2204. Told him to change it and turn on two-step.\n- Second phone for jobs only: (02) 5550 0142\n\nTO DO: lodge STP, draft payment plan ($600/mth?), ring him Fri 14th.   BK", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "307 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Lachlan Petherbridge", "B